  "content": {
    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "about",
        "slug": "about",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "A quiet photographer for loud, happy days.",
          "eyebrow": "About",
          "intro": "evermore is a small wedding photography studio working across Tuscany and wherever else a couple would like to be married.",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k14",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "I started evermore after years of photographing other people's weddings and realising that my favourite frames were never the ones I had planned. They were the ones in between: a father adjusting a tie, a bride laughing mid-sentence, two friends hugging at the edge of the dance floor.",
                  "_key": "k14s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k15",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "So that is how we work. We arrive early, learn the shape of your day, and then stay out of the way. You will get a handful of portraits that are properly directed, because they matter, and the rest will be real.",
                  "_key": "k15s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k16",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "How we work",
                  "_key": "k16s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k17",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "We take on a limited number of weddings each year, so that every couple gets the same attention before, during and after the day. We answer every inquiry personally, usually within two working days.",
                  "_key": "k17s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k18",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Most of our weddings are in Tuscany, but we travel. If you are planning something further away, tell us where and we will send a travel estimate with your quote.",
                  "_key": "k18s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "terms-and-delivery",
        "slug": "terms-and-delivery",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Terms and delivery",
          "eyebrow": "Good to know",
          "intro": "A few things that help every wedding run smoothly.",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k19",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Booking",
                  "_key": "k19s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k20",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "An inquiry is not a booking. We reply by email, agree the package and date with you, and confirm with a short written agreement and a deposit.",
                  "_key": "k20s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k21",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Delivery",
                  "_key": "k21s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k22",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Your online gallery arrives within four weeks of the wedding. Elopements are delivered within two weeks.",
                  "_key": "k22s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k23",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Travel",
                  "_key": "k23s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k24",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Weddings in Tuscany include travel. Further afield, we add the actual cost of travel and a place to stay.",
                  "_key": "k24s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "stories": [
      {
        "id": "mara-and-elio",
        "slug": "mara-and-elio",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Mara & Elio",
          "place": "Villa dei Cipressi, Tuscany",
          "date_label": "14 September 2025",
          "summary": "A hilltop ceremony, a long veil and an evening that never quite wanted to end.",
          "featured": true,
          "position": 10,
          "photo": "/images/hero-home.webp",
          "gallery": [
            {
              "photo": "/images/embrace-close.webp",
              "caption": "Mara and Elio, moments after the ceremony."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/bouquet.webp",
              "caption": "Peonies, garden roses and olive leaves."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/veil.webp",
              "caption": "The veil caught every breeze on the terrace."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/hills.webp",
              "caption": "Cypress trees at the edge of the estate."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/table-setting.webp",
              "caption": "The long table, set for forty guests."
            }
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k1",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Mara and Elio had one request: no stiff posing, and a lot of time outside. The ceremony was held on the terrace of Villa dei Cipressi as the light turned gold, with their families seated in a loose half circle under the olive trees.",
                  "_key": "k1s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k2",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "We spent most of the portrait hour walking the grounds with them, saying very little. The best frames came in between the directions: a quiet laugh, a hand held a beat longer, a veil lifting in the wind.",
                  "_key": "k2s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k3",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Dinner was served at a single long table. By the time the candles were lit, nobody was checking a phone.",
                  "_key": "k3s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "hana-and-theo",
        "slug": "hana-and-theo",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Hana & Theo",
          "place": "Terrazza Lago, Lake Orsa",
          "date_label": "3 May 2025",
          "summary": "A small lakeside wedding with forty guests and a sunset worth waiting for.",
          "featured": true,
          "position": 20,
          "photo": "/images/lake-couple.webp",
          "gallery": [
            {
              "photo": "/images/camera.webp",
              "caption": "Between the ceremony and the toasts."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/prints.webp",
              "caption": "Prints for their parents, made within the week."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/lake-couple.webp",
              "caption": "Hana and Theo on the terrace at sunset."
            }
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k4",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Hana and Theo kept their guest list to forty people and their schedule to almost nothing. We arrived two hours before the ceremony to photograph the quiet parts: the hair, the letters, the rings in a small dish.",
                  "_key": "k4s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k5",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "At sunset the whole party drifted down to the water. We stayed back and let it happen.",
                  "_key": "k5s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nora-and-james",
        "slug": "nora-and-james",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Nora & James",
          "place": "Via dei Cipressi, Tuscany",
          "date_label": "21 June 2025",
          "summary": "A walk down a stone lane after the ceremony, in black and white.",
          "featured": true,
          "position": 30,
          "photo": "/images/walking-bw.webp",
          "gallery": [
            {
              "photo": "/images/walking-bw.webp",
              "caption": "The lane behind the chapel."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/hills.webp",
              "caption": "The view from the garden wall."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/rings-card.webp",
              "caption": "Nora's vows, written on card for each guest."
            }
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k6",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Nora and James walked from the chapel to the dinner on foot, hand in hand, with their guests following at a respectful distance.",
                  "_key": "k6s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k7",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "We photographed the lane in black and white to keep the focus on the two of them, and kept the colour for the table and the flowers.",
                  "_key": "k7s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "isla-and-daniel",
        "slug": "isla-and-daniel",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Isla & Daniel",
          "place": "Podere Alta, Tuscany",
          "date_label": "8 October 2025",
          "summary": "An autumn garden dinner with candles, linen and a very long table.",
          "featured": false,
          "position": 40,
          "photo": "/images/table-setting.webp",
          "gallery": [
            {
              "photo": "/images/table-setting.webp",
              "caption": "The table before the guests arrived."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/bouquet.webp",
              "caption": "The bouquet, left on a chair during dinner."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/veil.webp",
              "caption": "A walk before sunset."
            }
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k8",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Isla and Daniel hosted sixty guests at one long table in the garden of Podere Alta. The florist worked only with what was growing within ten miles.",
                  "_key": "k8s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k9",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "We photographed the table setting just before the guests arrived, then put the camera down to join the first toast.",
                  "_key": "k9s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "priya-and-sam",
        "slug": "priya-and-sam",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Priya & Sam",
          "place": "Casa del Colle, Tuscany",
          "date_label": "17 August 2025",
          "summary": "Handwritten notes, two gold rings and an intimate ceremony at home.",
          "featured": false,
          "position": 50,
          "photo": "/images/rings-card.webp",
          "gallery": [
            {
              "photo": "/images/rings-card.webp",
              "caption": "The rings, resting on Priya's note to Sam."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/camera-prints.webp",
              "caption": "Prints from the day, laid out for the family."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/embrace-close.webp",
              "caption": "A quiet minute together."
            }
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k10",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Priya and Sam married in the garden of Sam's grandparents' house, with their closest family seated on borrowed chairs.",
                  "_key": "k10s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k11",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "The day was full of small written things: place cards, a note slipped into a jacket pocket, a promise on a card beside the rings. We made sure each one was photographed.",
                  "_key": "k11s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
